    {
      "type": "fieldframe:text",
      "text": "The first machine most people build: a **Heater** on top, a **Fuel Engine** underneath and an **Inventory Access Panel** in front. Put ore in **Orange storage** and coal in **Purple storage** through the panel; ingots come out in **Green storage**. One coal smelts eight items, as in a furnace, and the Heater is twice as fast."
